Z||000000||PearlBlueSoul||12-02-2000||11:24 PM||||Met up with Travis again tonight, this time I had his friend drive my 2 out there.  Against the will of the Man in Blue, I went ahead and took him for a spin in my 2.  Was a fun night, cold as sh!t, drizzling, but we saw a few cool cars.  Had stupid people asking about both of our cars, but that's expected (quite a few people are "sponsored by mommy".  I'm a tad hypocritical, but I bought my car back from my parents.  She's all mine now).  Spent the better part of 2 hours talkin, laughin, and trying to stay warm.  <P>Hey, Marc, where were ya man?  I was kinda hopin I might get to meet someone else from the board.   <P>------------------<BR>1987 Toyota MR2 N/A 5 speed<BR>  <A HREF="http://www.atlantamr2s.com" TARGET=_blank>http://www.atlantamr2s.com</A>  <BR><A HREF="http://www.geocities.com/darionscard" TARGET=_blank>http://www.geocities.com/darionscard</A>  <BR>     <IMG SRC="http://www.geocities.com/darionscard/Thumb.jpg">        <BR><B>Notable mods:</B>  Sus tech springs and sway bars, Toyota strut tower brace, KYB strut inserts, HKS exhaust, NGK plugs/wires, Momo Racer wheels (14x6), Custom intake, Kenwood 12" speaker in front trunk, Jensen amp.<p>[This message has been edited by PearlBlueSoul (edited 12-02-2000).]||||reg||1
