Z||000005||1FST2M6||12-04-2000||08:14 AM||||his car does ride like a go cart!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"> i was surprised that the RPMs don't resonatate throught the body like most of the 4cyl cars i've ridden in  /  driven... love that HKS exhaust!  my tags are good till June!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"> (technicly) thanks to GT Bastard! gotta bypass my egr solenoid to make the EGR work.. then i'll be able to pass emissions.  lame high NOx...  maybe it'll be warmer next time...<P>oh to all you stereo guys.. He's got a 12" sub in teh front of his car! it's STOOOOOPID clear and strong! he has WAY less front trunk space than we do!  I was impressed! ||||reg||1
Z||000006||PearlBlueSoul||12-04-2000||02:48 PM||||hehee, yah, next time I hope you've got the right 3.4 injectors in that suker.  ehhe.  I KNOW that couldn'tve possibly been that car's true potential.  I can't wait to see what it feels like running closer to rich than lean.  That would give me some true bead on how it normally drives. <P>Gotta say tho, I want those wider tires!!  ugh, my car SCREAMS for more traction.  Corners don't like the 60 series sidewall, and braking hates the 185 width.  Anyone wanna start a fund for a set of 15x7.5s?    <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">  hehe<P>Just kidding! but thas cool tho.  Thanks alot for the compliments.  <p>[This message has been edited by PearlBlueSoul (edited 12-04-2000).]||||reg||1
