Z||000008||PearlBlueSoul||12-04-2000||03:56 PM||||I'm not talkin bout race rubber here!  hehe.  Need street shoes man.  can't afford racing tires every few months.  That's what you call Pirellis:  Shitty race tires.   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">  <P>But seriously, koo..woulndn't mind lending a hand doing that fiero dissection project.  would this be on your edible orange Fiero?  or another one that I havnen't seen yet?  Has Taylor talked to you about the turbo setup we came up with the other night for my car?  GZE with a HKS header n some other goodies?  He's got me seriously hell bent to do that swap!  hehe.  my friend thinks I'm nuts and wasting my time converting from s/c to turbo (thinks I should just mod the S/C) but I commented to him that he's trying to make a SHO wagon which is just as ludicrus.  hehe.  So, we've both got our strange obsessions.  <P>Think I could ask you guys to teach me some basics on reading flow charts and trim levels, whatever other jargon is associated with turbo stuff?  I'm very itchy to get some learnin' done here.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">  hehe<P>Hey, do you have AIM?  I've got you on ICQ but you don't show (unless you're on invis-o mode)||||reg||1
